@page "/reports"
@attribute [RouteName("reports")]
@attribute [RouteTitle("Reports")]
@attribute [Authorize(Roles = "admin")]
@inherits CountedPage

@* Administrators only: the folder's [Authorize] (any signed-in user) AND this role, as [Authorize] attributes combine.
   An anonymous visitor gets NotAuthorized, so the app's fragment renders RedirectToLogin; a signed-in user gets the
   message; an administrator the page. *@
<p id="reports">Reports (administrators only) (@Counters)</p>
